    'password-generator': ['Password Generator', 'builds a password from the selected length and enabled uppercase, lowercase, number, and symbol pools', ['Length and character-set controls', 'Strength indicator', 'Copy and TXT download'], ['Selected generator settings'], ['Generated password', 'TXT'], 'It chooses each character with crypto.getRandomValues. The displayed meter is length-based guidance, not a password audit.', ['A password can still be exposed through reuse, clipboard history, screenshots, or insecure storage.', 'The generator does not create or manage an account credential for you.'], 'Generate a 20-character value with all four character groups, then store it in a trusted password manager.', ['uuid-generator', 'hash-tool', 'base64-tool']],
